{"t":"LUNR","made":"2026-11-24 14:32","name":"Intuitive Machines, Inc.","ko":"인튜이티브머신스","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":525,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.intuitivemachines.com","summary_en":"Intuitive Machines, Inc. operates as a space infrastructure and services company in the United States. The company provides delivery services for the transportation and delivery of payloads, such as satellites, scientific instruments, and cargo to various destinations in space, rideshare delivery, and lunar surface access; data transmission services, which include the collection, processing, and interpretation of space-based data, as well as utilizing AI applications, such as command, control, communications, reconnaissance and prospecting; and infrastructure as a service solutions for navigation, maintenance, scientific data collection, and system health monitoring. It also offers Nova-C lunar lander that combines flight-proven with a scalable design to meet the demands of the emerging lunar economy; Micro Nova Hopper develops propulsive drone that is designed to land, deploy, and hop on the company's IM-2 mission; and Nova-D developed to transport critical payloads, including infrastructure services, such as fission surface power systems, lunar terrain vehicles, and rovers enabling sustainable lunar exploration and development. In addition, the company provides lunar data network. It serves its products to the U.S. government, which include NASA, national security space, U.S. department of Defense, and state governments; commercial; and international customers. The company was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Intuitive Machines, Inc.는 미국에서 우주 인프라 및 서비스 회사로 운영되고 있습니다. 회사는 위성, 과학 장비, 화물 등 탑재체를 우주의 다양한 목적지로 운송하고 배송하는 배송 서비스, 차량 공유 배송, 달 표면 접근을 위한 배송 서비스를 제공합니다. 우주 기반 데이터의 수집, 처리 및 해석뿐만 아니라 명령, 제어, 통신, 정찰 및 탐사와 같은 AI 애플리케이션 활용을 포함하는 데이터 전송 서비스 탐색, 유지 관리, 과학적 데이터 수집 및 시스템 상태 모니터링을 위한 서비스 솔루션으로서의 인프라입니다. 또한, 비행에서 입증된 달 착륙선과 확장 가능한 설계를 결합하여 신흥 달 경제의 요구 사항을 충족하는 Nova-C 달 착륙선도 제공합니다. Micro Nova Hopper는 회사의 IM-2 임무에 착륙, 배치 및 뛰어오르도록 설계된 추진 드론을 개발합니다. Nova-D는 핵분열 표면 전력 시스템, 달 지형 차량, 지속 가능한 달 탐사 및 개발을 가능하게 하는 탐사선과 같은 인프라 서비스를 포함하여 중요한 탑재량을 운송하기 위해 개발되었습니다. 또한 회사는 달 데이터 네트워크를 제공합니다. NASA, 국가 안보 공간, 미국 국방부 및 주 정부를 포함하는 미국 정부에 제품을 제공합니다. 광고; 그리고 국제 고객. 이 회사는 2013년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":9.75,"mcap":1729597440.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-55.187637,"peg":null,"ps":2.4462824,"pb":7.3640485,"ev_ebitda":-37.341,"div":0.0,"beta":1.907,"hi52":46.75,"lo52":8.245},"fin":{"rev":707030976.0,"rev_g":4.137,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.20333,"op":-0.15867,"net":-0.18065001,"roe":-0.28081,"fcf":1074375.0,"cash":463809984.0,"debt":554475008.0,"de":54.009,"eps":-0.9,"feps":-0.17667},"own":{"short":0.2442,"inst":0.92256,"insider":0.04934},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":25.2,"median":25.5,"high":38.0,"low":13.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.33333,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":8,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":9,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":8,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"B. Riley Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":34.0,"priorPriceTarget":43.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":30.0,"priorPriceTarget":38.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm":"Macquarie","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":25.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-31","Firm":"B of A Securities","ToGrade":"Underperform","FromGrade":"Underperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":13.0,"priorPriceTarget":11.0}